# Anchored to the one directory that actually holds runtime uploads. Written
# as a bare `storage/` this matched *any* directory of that name at any depth,
# which silently excluded apps/api/src/core/storage/ — the StorageService
# source — from the repository. A fresh clone did not compile, and nothing in
# this working tree showed it, because the file was present locally.
/apps/api/storage/
/tmp/
